# Licence

Two legally distinct kinds of material will live in this repository, under different terms.
Read `COPYRIGHT.md` before reusing anything.

## 1. The recordings and the transcript text — NO claim is made

**Prime Rogue Inc. claims no ownership of the Mriya Report's broadcasts, and no ownership
of the transcript text of what was said in them.**

Copyright in the broadcasts and in the speakers' contributions rests with their respective
rights holders. Nothing here grants any licence to that material and none should be
inferred.

It is reproduced for **news reporting, research, criticism and review** under the fair
dealing provisions of the Copyright Act (R.S.C. 1985, c. C-42), ss. 29–29.2. Fair dealing
for news reporting is conditional on attribution, and every item here names its source.

If you want to reuse the recordings or the spoken words, that is between you and the rights
holders.

